  Inventory basis: the three test cases below, their names and their order are read directly from
  the class's own source at
  acm-plugins/acm-default-plugins/acm-person-plugin/src/test/java/com/armedia/acm/plugins/person/service/PersonAssociationEventPublisherTest.java
